    <section class="page-body">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="prose">
          <p class="muted">Last updated 2 July 2026.</p>

          <h2>About this site</h2>
          <p>This site describes what Fettle does and lets you check whether we have room on our list. Prices shown &ndash; such as &ldquo;from &pound;140&rdquo; for a half-day &ndash; are a guide. A first visit to see the job and give you a price is &pound;30, and your actual quote for the work comes after that visit, once we&rsquo;ve seen it. Homes further than about 4 miles from our base in Chelsea may have a small travel charge added to the work (never to the visit); if so, it&rsquo;s shown on the website when you enter your postcode and on your quote.</p>

          <h2>Booking work</h2>
          <p>Checking availability or getting in touch isn&rsquo;t a booking. A job is agreed only once we&rsquo;ve visited, given you a price, and you&rsquo;ve said yes. We take on a limited number of homes, so a slot near you isn&rsquo;t guaranteed.</p>

          <h2>Our work</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>We do the work with reasonable care and skill, and leave a tidy finish.</li>
            <li>Specialist work &ndash; rendering, tree surgery &ndash; is carried out by vetted specialists we bring in.</li>
            <li>If something isn&rsquo;t right, tell us and we&rsquo;ll put it right.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Payment</h2>
          <p>The first video call is free. If we need to visit to price the job, the &pound;30 visit fee is deducted from your invoice whenever you go ahead with the work. If it turns out not to be a job for us, we refund it. We invoice for the half-day or full-day agreed, plus any materials. Terms are set out on your quote.</p>

          <h2>Membership</h2>
          <p>Membership plans run for twelve months, paid monthly or once for the year, by card or Direct Debit through Stripe. Paying yearly costs ten months&rsquo; worth for the full twelve. After the first twelve months, a monthly plan carries on month to month and you can leave any time with a month&rsquo;s notice; a yearly plan renews each year unless you tell us before it does. If you move house, tell us and we&rsquo;ll end the plan.</p>
          <p>If you leave in the first year, you pay the normal price of any visits you&rsquo;ve had, less what you&rsquo;ve paid so far. If you&rsquo;ve paid more than that &ndash; on a yearly plan, say &ndash; we refund the difference.</p>
          <p>If you join online, you have fourteen days to change your mind and get your money back. If you ask us to make a visit within those fourteen days, we&rsquo;ll refund the payment less a fair amount for the work already done. If we find there isn&rsquo;t room for your home, we refund you in full.</p>
          <p>If a monthly payment fails, Stripe will try again and let you know. Visits are paused until the plan is up to date. Bigger jobs, materials and specialist work are quoted separately.</p>

          <h2>This content</h2>
          <p>The words, marks, and images on this site belong to Fettle. Please don&rsquo;t reuse them without asking.</p>

          <hr class="divider" />
          <p class="muted">Need the detail on a specific job? <a href="/contact">Talk to us</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
</Page>
